IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ITEMCALC.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 ITEM-INPUT PIC 9(7)V99.
01 ITEM-OUTPUT PIC 9(9)V99.
COPY ERRAREA.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ITEM-INPUT ITEM-OUTPUT ERROR-AREA.
CALCULATE-ITEM.
    MOVE ZERO TO ITEM-OUTPUT.
    IF ITEM-INPUT = ZERO
        MOVE 41 TO PROCESS-STATUS
        MOVE 'ITEM-CALC' TO ERROR-STAGE
        MOVE 'ACTIVE-ITEM-ZERO' TO ERROR-CODE
    ELSE
        COMPUTE ITEM-OUTPUT ROUNDED = ITEM-INPUT * 1.25
            ON SIZE ERROR
                MOVE 42 TO PROCESS-STATUS
                MOVE 'ITEM-CALC' TO ERROR-STAGE
                MOVE 'ITEM-OVERFLOW' TO ERROR-CODE
        END-COMPUTE
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
